msgstr " 4. Användar-ID (UserID). Detta är en pseudonym som genereras av UserReporter första gången den används (GDPR 4.5, GDPR 25.1, GDPR 32.1.a)."

msgid " 4. Wildfire Games informs users of the purposes, legal grounds, legitimate interests and retention periods of personal data processing at the time it is processed, recipients of personal data and where applicable, transfer of personal data to third countries and automated decision-making (GDPR 13.1.c-f, GDPR 13.2.a, GDPR 13.2.e, GDPR 13.2.f, GDPR 15.1, GDPR 15.4)."
